usage: compare_standard_network_portable.py [-h] --data DATA [--output OUTPUT]
                                            [--model MODEL]
                                            [--baseline-source BASELINE_SOURCE]

Reproduce the saved same-target network comparison; training needs CUDA,
evaluation uses CPU.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --data DATA           BSDS500 directory containing train, val and test JPG
                        directories
